  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-04-29T08:25:04.259Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Before the late December update, the avatar's torso would follow the head movement exactly even when spinning quickly.\n\nEver since the late December update, when you spin quickly, the avatar's torso does not follow the head movement, and it looks very jarring.\n\nThe workarounds to prevent this issue are to extend arms out completely while spinning, which limits the dance moves you can do, or to keep your head completely still while spinning, which is very difficult to do.\n\nThis makes dancing in vr chat very difficult and ruins the quality of the dance on twitch streams and youtube videos.\n\nThis issue affects all avatars in vr chat.",
